# ============================================================
# Frontend build-time environment / Build-time frontend variables
# ============================================================
# These variables are loaded by Vite from `frontend/.env*` at build/dev time
# (`pnpm dev` / `pnpm build`). They are NOT read from the repo-root `.env`.
# Vite loads these variables from `frontend/.env*` at build/dev time (`pnpm dev` /
# `pnpm build`), never from the repository-root `.env`.
#
# Copy this file to `frontend/.env` (gitignored) and adjust as needed.
# Copy this file to `frontend/.env` (gitignored) and adjust as needed.

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Brand / Branding
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Override the displayed product name, tagline and meta description.
# Empty = upstream defaults. Affects browser tab title, <meta description>,
# login page logo text, project lobby header, and every user-visible string
# that uses the i18n `[[brand]]` placeholder — see frontend/src/branding.ts.
# Override the UI product name, tagline, and <meta description>. Leave blank for upstream defaults.
# Affects browser tab titles, meta descriptions, login-page logo text, project-lobby headers, and all user-visible
# locations (including the i18n `[[brand]]` placeholder); see frontend/src/branding.ts.
# VITE_BRAND_NAME=ArcReel
# VITE_BRAND_TAGLINE=Agent 驱动的 AI 视频创作工作台
# VITE_BRAND_DESCRIPTION=AI 视频创作工作台，统一管理项目、脚本、分镜、视频生成与 Agent 对话。
